  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MisanthropyDev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"patreon-singular\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Linggango/Linggango\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/github-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"github-plural\" height=\"56\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/linggango\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_64h.png\" alt=\"curseforge\" height=\"56\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/CKjFgGdY/backgorund.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"775\" height=\"324\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/xtzpSZR6\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fb766a\"><strong>&nbsp;» 一般說明：</strong>&nbsp;<strong><em>在 CurseForge 中選擇「使用 Mojang 啟動器」</em>選項。</strong><br><strong>» Linux 使用者：</strong> <strong>停用</strong> </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Spark</strong></a> &amp; <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iris-flywheel-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris 與 Oculus 與 Flywheel 相容性修復</a></strong><span style=\"color:#fb766a\">&nbsp;<strong>模組以確保穩定性。</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#fb766a\"><strong>» 記憶體分配：至少 6 GB，建議 8 GB。</strong></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong>Linggango 是一個含有大量自訂內容的模組包，隱約帶有 Terraria 的靈感。<br>裡面充滿了自訂內容和獨特的遊戲機制，等你來玩！<br><br>目前處於 Beta 階段，意味著我會隨著開發持續更新與完善。</strong></strong><br><br></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><em>Discord 伺服器中包含伺服器包與開發進度更新。</em><strong><br><br></strong></em></h3><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/linggango\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_64h.png\" alt=\"discord-plural\" width=\"254\" height=\"74\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/tTJwFS0g/523.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1067\" height=\"109\"><br></strong></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-&nbsp; 徹底改版的進度系統 &nbsp;-</strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">» 你不能只是快速通關遊戲。武器、工具以及一堆東西都被鎖在王後面！<br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5XWQVx5X/proghint2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1720\" height=\"720\"><strong><em><br></em></strong></h3>\n</div><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>-&nbsp; 獨特的遊戲風格 &nbsp;-<br></strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">» 玩家從兩個戒指開始他們的旅程，這兩個戒指會<strong>大幅</strong>改變遊戲體驗。</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WWX8p6xJ/Ekran-g-r-nt-s-2026-07-03-043452.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1718\" height=\"720\"><br><br><strong>七咒之戒<br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WWCjhWQ4/Ekran-g-r-nt-s-2026-07-03-043637.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1720\" height=\"720\"><br></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>七德之戒<br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GvpyhWkp/Ekran-g-r-nt-s-2026-07-03-043650.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"773\" height=\"324\"><br><br></strong>兩者都有其優點與缺點</h3>\n</div><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>-&nbsp; 超過 60 位 BOSS &nbsp;-<br></strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">» &nbsp;Linggango 有許多 BOSS 等你來挑戰！<br>不過要注意。有些 BOSS 真的不是那麼簡單。<br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/6RZpm1nX/2026-01-12-05-57-51.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1720\" height=\"720\"><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xSVsdQxk/2026-01-12-06-05-42.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1720\" height=\"720\"><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SXSKT21y/2026-01-12-06-02-47.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1720\" height=\"720\"></h3>\n</div><h1><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-&nbsp; 任務系統 &nbsp;-<br></strong></h1><h3 class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">» <strong>一本巨大的任務書</strong>，引導你完成進度並了解其他模組！<br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fYk66Fwx/javaw-8a-T3s7ka9q.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"416\" height=\"1344\"></h3><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>-&nbsp; 美麗的世界生成 &nbsp;-<br></strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">» 具有前所未有的獨特地形生成，這是 Forge 環境中從未見過的。<br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2ph4cMh/2026-06-26-16-03-43.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LXWgRWXL/2026-06-05-04-31-49.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4ZJxkvxX/2026-06-26-16-10-22.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rf66Wphc/2026-06-26-16-07-08.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1720\" height=\"720\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/S4nBRDmN/2026-06-26-16-14-37.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/NdYPLKBt/2026-07-03-04-55-46.png\" alt=\"\"></h3>\n</div><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>-&nbsp; 最佳化 &nbsp;-<br></strong></h1><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">» 最佳化是我們的首要任務，這樣每個人都能玩得開心！這次是認真的。我不像其他很多模組包只加了幾個最佳化模組就草草了事。<br><br>以下是我之前做過的一些效能基準測試。<br><br>提醒您，這個包在穩定性和效能方面還會繼續改進，因為它還在 Beta 階段！<br><br></h3>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">基準測試 1</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>系統硬體：</strong></span><br><br>GPU: RX 5700 XT<br>CPU: Ryzen 5 5600<br>RAM: 16GB 3200mhz<br><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>遊戲設定：</strong></span><br><br>12 區塊<br>垂直同步 = 關閉<br>最大幀數 = 無限制<br>光影 = Complementary<br>Linggango 版本 = v4.5~<br><br><em>幀數約 120+ FPS，幾乎沒有掉幀情況<br></em></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">基準測試 2</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>系統硬體：<br></strong></span><br>GPU: RX 9070 XT<br>CPU: Ryzen 7 7800x3D<br>RAM: 32GB 5600mhz<br><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">遊戲設定：<br><br></span></strong>32 區塊<br>垂直同步 = 關閉<br>最大幀數 = 無限制<br>光影 = Complementary<br>Linggango 版本 = v6.5<br><br>幀數約 110-130 FPS，幾乎沒有掉幀情況。</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">基準測試 3</span><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>系統硬體：</strong></span><br><br>GPU: RX 7800 XT<br>CPU: Ryzen 5 5600X<br>RAM: 32GB 3600mhz<br><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">遊戲設定：</span></strong><br><br>12 區塊<br>垂直同步 = 關閉<br>最大幀數 = 無限制<br>光影 = 關閉<br>Linggango 版本 = v6.4~<br><br>幀數約 500-600 FPS，沒有明顯掉幀。</p>\n</div><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>- 想和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></em></h3><h4 style=\"text-align:center\">＞ 透過 Kinetic Hosting，以一個快樂餐的價格租用高品質伺服器！<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.com%252fmodpacks%252flingango%252forder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9mR5GxD4/z-Ikb-PZc.png\" width=\"611\" height=\"217\"></a><br><em>（點擊圖片即可！）<br><br></em></h4><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mC9Wb471/minecraft-title-16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"97\"></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/crGuVObvnes?t=26s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/s5NXZ_ALTZw?t=5s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/X47i8oUENo4?t=167s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hAvaTPlVIZs?t=2s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
